{"seq":4,"slug":"digital-media-arts","title":"数字媒体艺术","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts","introMarkdown":"# 数字媒体艺术 简介\n\n数字媒体艺术是一门融合艺术创意、数字技术与文化传播的交叉学科，隶属于艺术学门类设计学类。本课程体系面向大学数字媒体艺术专业学生，以\"技术+艺术+内容创作+跨界应用\"为四大支柱，系统培养具备数字创意思维与实践能力的复合型人才。\n\n当前全国已有286所高校开设数字媒体艺术相关专业，数字创意产业规模在2024年已达8.9万亿元。本专业毕业生可进入互联网媒体、影视传媒、游戏动画、人机交互、展示设计等多个高速增长领域。\n\n本课程包含以下四章核心内容：\n\n**第一章 数字艺术基础**——涵盖视觉语言与设计、数字影像技术、艺术理论与美学三大模块，为后续专业方向奠定扎实的审美素养与技术功底。\n\n**第二章 影视动画创作**——聚焦视听语言与叙事、三维建模与动画、后期特效与合成，培养从前期创意到后期制作的完整影视动画生产能力。\n\n**第三章 交互体验设计**——围绕UI/UX设计、沉浸式体验设计、游戏交互设计展开，训练以用户为中心的数字产品设计思维与实现技术。\n\n**第四章 新兴数字媒体**——探索AIGC创意应用、虚拟制作与元宇宙、新媒体运营三大前沿方向，帮助学生把握行业最新趋势与创业机遇。\n\n推荐学习路径为：先修第一章建立视觉素养与技术基础，再根据兴趣选择第二章（影视方向）或第三章（交互方向）深入，最后通过第四章了解产业前沿与跨界融合。各章内容既可按序学习形成完整知识体系，也可根据项目需求灵活组合。\n\n核心工具链包括 Adobe 全家桶、Blender、Cinema 4D、Unity/Unreal Engine、DaVinci Resolve 等行业标准软件，课程将结合具体项目实训逐步引入。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-art-foundations","title":"数字艺术基础","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/digital-art-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"visual-language-design","title":"视觉语言与设计","url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/digital-art-foundations/visual-language-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-imaging-techniques","title":"数字影像技术","url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/digital-art-foundations/digital-imaging-techniques"},{"seq":3,"slug":"art-theory-aesthetics","title":"艺术理论与美学","url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/digital-art-foundations/art-theory-aesthetics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"film-animation-creation","title":"影视动画创作","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/film-animation-creation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"film-language-narrative","title":"视听语言与叙事","url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/film-animation-creation/film-language-narrative"},{"seq":2,"slug":"3d-modeling-animation","title":"三维建模与动画","url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/film-animation-creation/3d-modeling-animation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vfx-compositing","title":"后期特效与合成","url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/film-animation-creation/vfx-compositing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"interactive-experience-design","title":"交互体验设计","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/interactive-experience-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ui-ux-design","title":"UI/UX 设计","url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/interactive-experience-design/ui-ux-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"immersive-experience-design","title":"沉浸式体验设计","url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/interactive-experience-design/immersive-experience-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"game-interaction-design","title":"游戏交互设计","url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/interactive-experience-design/game-interaction-design"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"emerging-digital-media","title":"新兴数字媒体","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/emerging-digital-media","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aigc-creative-applications","title":"AIGC 创意应用","url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/emerging-digital-media/aigc-creative-applications"},{"seq":2,"slug":"virtual-production-metaverse","title":"虚拟制作与元宇宙","url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/emerging-digital-media/virtual-production-metaverse"},{"seq":3,"slug":"new-media-operations","title":"新媒体运营","url":"/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/emerging-digital-media/new-media-operations"}]}]}